<p>Hi <%= @rsvp.first_name %>,</p>

<p>Someone, hopefully you, used the RSVP form to cancel or reduce the confirmed reservation for this email address (<%= @rsvp.email %>) for the <%= @rsvp.show.name %> house concert on <%= @rsvp.show.start_date %>.</p>

<p>Confirmed reservations can only be cancelled or reduced from your own link, so nothing has changed yet: you still have <%= pluralize(@seats, "seat") %>. To make the change, <%= link_to "update your reservation", @rsvp_url %>.</p>

<p>If you didn’t ask for this, you don’t need to do anything.</p>

<p>thanks!
<br />Paul</p>
